title: "Drop-In Hybrid Post-Quantum Key Exchange for TLS 1.3 at Zero Trust Boundaries: Architecture, Functional Validation, and an Open Evaluation Agenda"
abstract: "Reference architecture, reproducible procedure, and functional validation of the hybrid post-quantum TLS 1.3 key exchange group X25519MLKEM768 (X25519 + ML-KEM-768, RFC 10024) with OpenSSL 3.5, with an open evaluation agenda for community measurement."
